{"text": "My dear Fortunato, I said, how lucky I am to meet you, because I have just received a cask of Amontillado. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But I have my doubts, and I was foolish enough to pay the full price without asking your advice first. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As I could not find you anywhere, I am on my way to Luchresi, who will surely tell me the truth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Luchresi cannot tell Amontillado from ordinary sherry, Fortunato said, and yet some fools say that his taste matches mine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come, let us go to your vaults at once, for it is I who must judge the wine, he insisted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I warned him that the vaults were cold and damp and covered with nitre, a white salt that grows on the walls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I had known that you had such a bad cold, I would have gone straight to Luchresi, I said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The cold is nothing, he answered, and he took my arm as I put on a black silk mask and a long cloak. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were no servants at home, for I had told them that I would not return until morning and had ordered them to stay. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I knew well that this order would send them all running to the carnival as soon as my back was turned.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "y", " ", "d", "e", "a", "r", " ", "F", "o", "r", "t", "u", "n", "a", "t", "o", ",", " ", "I", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "h", "o", "w", " ", "l", "u", "c", "k", "y", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "e", "e", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", ",", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "I", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "j", "u", "s", "t", " ", "r", "e", "c", "e", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "c", "a", "s", "k", " ", "o", "f", " ", "A", "m", "o", "n", "t", "i", "l", "l", "a", "d", "o", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "I", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e",